    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "Every native cell is a circle/disk carrier with a distinguished center."
    },
    {
      "line": 25,
      "text": "The origin is not a cell center and is not itself a cell. It is a triple boundary-intersection vertex of three neighboring circle cells."
    },
    {
      "line": 29,
      "text": "`ORIGIN_IS_TRIPLE_CELL_INTERSECTION`."
    },
    {
      "line": 31,
